<title>GERMANY: Germany's Duerr wins 400 mln dmk order from Audi.</title>
<headline>Germany's Duerr wins 400 mln dmk order from Audi.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German plant manufacturer Duerr AG said on Tuesday it had won an order worth about 400 million marks to build a paint shop for carmaker Audi AG.</p>
<p>The paint shop will be completed by end-1998 and will have capacity to spray about 400,000 car bodies per year, Duerr said in a statement. It will be located at Audi's plant in Ingolstadt.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
